ou want to  take a quick  photo sure you can keep the screens open  like this but again  see scenario number two oh yeah the  camera's not very good either  so should you buy the surface duo  definitely not but that was not the  point of this review  the point of this review was to show you  how microsoft and google  are thinking differently about the  future of the phone or  tablet or whatever you call this thing  samsung's new galaxy fold 2 hints at a  similar type of future  where our devices transform when we need  them to do certain things  for a while i thought this whole thing  was a gimmick and unnecessary  but microsoft's first entry has made me  think differently about it all  next time just make sure the software  works oh and include a fanny pack
 

